  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Vereinsladen, in dem Kunsthandwerk, lokale Lebensmittel, Kosmetika und schöne Gebrauchtwaren angeboten werden.\r\nWorkshops für Kinder und Erwachsene, Austausch und Diskussionen rund um die Themen Konsum, Zusammenleben..."
    ],
    "en": [
      "‘Le bocal’ is a shop run by volunteers where you find crafts, local produce,\r\ncosmetics and quality second-hand articles. As it is also a place for sharing skills; we organise workshops for children and adults throughout the year: creative workshops (paper, sewing, felt...), cosmetic workshops, themed discussions and debates about consumption, tolerance..."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Un negozio comunitario di artigianato, prodotti alimentari locali, cosmetici e oggetti di seconda mano.\r\nLaboratori per bambini e adulti, scambi e discussioni sui temi del consumo, della convivenza..."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Boutique associative où on trouve de l'artisanat, de l'épicerie locale, des cosmétiques et de la belle occasion.\r\nAteliers enfants et adultes, échanges et discussions autour des thématiques de consommation, vivre ensemble..."
    ],
    "es": [
      "Una tienda comunitaria que vende artesanía, comestibles locales, cosméticos y artículos de segunda mano.\r\nTalleres para niños y adultos, debates sobre temas de consumo, convivencia..."
    ],
    "nl": [
      "Een buurtwinkel met ambachtelijke producten, lokale kruidenierswaren, cosmetica en tweedehands spullen.\r\nWorkshops voor kinderen en volwassenen, uitwisselingen en discussies over consumentenkwesties, samenleven..."
    ]
  },
